    "power bi desktop version": "2.154.1260.0",
    "description": "A multi-line chart showing performance (percent variance) from a user-selected origin to facilitate visual comparisons between categories",
    "notes": "origin date label on right of vertical rule for 1st half of dates and on left for 2nd half of dates",
    "template notes": "usermeta object is used by the Deneb template generation process and is thus overwritten, hence added here as a comment"
  },
